<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>

<pre><code class="language-sql">SELECT O.ANIMAL_ID, O.ANIMAL_TYPE, O.NAME
FROM ANIMAL_OUTS O
RIGHT OUTER JOIN (SELECT * 
                  FROM ANIMAL_INS 
                  WHERE SEX_UPON_INTAKE NOT LIKE ('%Spayed%')) I
ON O.ANIMAL_ID = I.ANIMAL_ID
WHERE SEX_UPON_OUTCOME != SEX_UPON_INTAKE
ORDER BY O.ANIMAL_ID ASC;
</code></pre>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="MySQL" /><category term="SQL" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[문제 설명]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 체육복</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 체육복" /><published>2021-12-27T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-27T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021-12-27-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이(</h2>
<pre><code class="language-python">def solution(n, lost, reserve):
    set_r = set(reserve)-set(lost)
    set_l = set(lost)-set(reserve)
    
    for i in set_r:
        if i-1 in set_l:
            set_l.remove(i-1)
        elif i+1 in set_l:
            set_l.remove(i+1)
    return n-len(set_l)
</code></pre>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기" /><published>2021-12-26T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-26T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021-12-26-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

