<pre><code class="language-python">def solution(n):

    answer = list(map(int, str(n)))

    return sum(answer)
</code></pre>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기" /><published>2021-12-25T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-25T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021-12-25-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이실패">풀이(실패)</h2>
<pre><code class="language-python">def solution(phone_number):
    
    for i in range(len(phone_number)-4):
        phone_number = phone_number.replace(phone_number[i], '*')
    
    return phone_number
</code></pre>

<ol>
  <li>실행결과 9번만 맞고 다른 결과는 실패로 나왔습니다. 찾아보니 9번 케이스는 문자열 길이가 4인 경우라고 하네요. 실행 전 테스트 케이스는 다 통과했었는데 실패하는 이유가 뭘까요?</li>
</ol>

<h2 id="풀이성공">풀이(성공)</h2>
<pre><code class="language-python">def solution(phone_number):
    return '*' * (len(phone_number)-4) + phone_number[-4:]
</code></pre>

